=head1 ENUMERATIONS

Every enumerator is exported as a constant sub.

=head2 SDL_GPUPrimitiveType

Specifies the primitive topology of a graphics pipeline.

=over

=item SDL_GPU_PRIMITIVETYPE_TRIANGLELIST = 0 - A series of separate triangles.

=item SDL_GPU_PRIMITIVETYPE_TRIANGLESTRIP = 1 - A series of connected triangles.

=item SDL_GPU_PRIMITIVETYPE_LINELIST = 2 - A series of separate lines.

=item SDL_GPU_PRIMITIVETYPE_LINESTRIP = 3 - A series of connected lines.

=item SDL_GPU_PRIMITIVETYPE_POINTLIST = 4 - A series of separate points.

=back

=head2 SDL_GPULoadOp

Specifies how the contents of a texture attached to a render pass are treated at the beginning of the render pass.

=over

=item SDL_GPU_LOADOP_LOAD = 0 - The previous contents of the texture will be preserved.

=item SDL_GPU_LOADOP_CLEAR = 1 - The contents of the texture will be cleared to a color.

=item SDL_GPU_LOADOP_DONT_CARE = 2 - The previous contents of the texture need not be preserved. The contents will be undefined.

=back

=head2 SDL_GPUStoreOp

Specifies how the contents of a texture attached to a render pass are treated at the end of the render pass.

=over

=item SDL_GPU_STOREOP_STORE = 0 - The contents generated during the render pass will be written to memory.

=item SDL_GPU_STOREOP_DONT_CARE = 1 - The contents generated during the render pass are not needed and may be discarded. The contents will be undefined.

=item SDL_GPU_STOREOP_RESOLVE = 2 - The multisample contents generated during the render pass will be resolved to a non-multisample texture. The contents in the multisample texture may then be discarded and will be undefined.

=item SDL_GPU_STOREOP_RESOLVE_AND_STORE = 3 - The multisample contents generated during the render pass will be resolved to a non-multisample texture. The contents in the multisample texture will be written to memory.

=back

=head2 SDL_GPUIndexElementSize

Specifies the size of elements in an index buffer.

=over

=item SDL_GPU_INDEXELEMENTSIZE_16BIT = 0 - The index elements are 16-bit.

=item SDL_GPU_INDEXELEMENTSIZE_32BIT = 1 - The index elements are 32-bit.

=back

